From 610073d47b83d5fa228272150b5d48b0955e9126 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 20:08:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08125/11362] [outer-loop] Correct three ARC artifacts after
 adversarial review, and record frontier exhaustion so a collapse stops
 reading as a saving

Applied the corrections that survived independent re-verification against the raw
cells. Every superseded number is left in place; each correction is ADDED beside it
with its reason (never-prune).

INDUCE-GATE ANATOMY (review returned holds=false; 7 corrections):
- The "6-7x gap" was wrong by ~5x. Max plain-branch verify_cell_recall is 0.2474
  over all 28 records, not 0.0476 over 14 -- 0.0476 was one arm's max, and the
  source says both metrics are recorded regardless of which one gates. The
  artifact's OWN field already said 0.2474; only the prose said otherwise.
- Withdrew "a threshold relaxation is not the lever" on the cell-recall axis: a
  threshold near 0.19 would admit three live engines. What survives is narrower and
  still decisive -- on the EXACT metric nothing between 0.0 and 0.5 admits the
  structural fit, and 16 of 22 hidden-state records fail nondegeneracy at ANY
  threshold.
- The delivery proof never covered the branch a HIDDEN game uses.
  HIDDEN_STATE_GAME_IDS is a hardcoded public-game tuple, so a hidden game always
  takes the PLAIN branch, and every gate-passing row was hidden-state. Ran the
  repair: a gate-passing engine on tu93 does reach the post-gate site
  (_induce_and_plan:6781), so the plain-branch channel is open.
- NEW, found while running that repair and stated by neither the artifact nor the
  review: when the reinduction loop finds a plan it installs it and STAGE 4 never
  runs, leaving verify_accuracy MISSING (not zero).
- Also: the census is public-games-only (43 of 136 decided by an unreachable
  branch); the plain gate is scored IN-SAMPLE, contradicting its own docstring and
  making every live number an upper bound; two label/scope imprecisions fixed.

ENGINE STORE (holds=true): retracted the single positive observation. Three of the
seven eligible cells have an uninformative baseline (0 true-changed cells), which is
a missing value wearing a numeric zero. Requiring an informative baseline leaves 4,
all vc33: 1 down, 1 UP, 2 flat, and the one apparent regression compares 1.0 over
141 cells against 0.93 over 44. Like-for-like destructive writes demonstrated: 0.
The retraction cuts in the finding's own direction.

GENERATION VS SELECTION (holds=true): the rule of three was computed over ENGINES
while the pre-registration declares GAME clustering -- up to ~12x overstated
(1.19% -> 13.9%). Corrected bounds added; the conclusion survives all three. Also
withdrew the claim that the stateless ceiling rules out distribution shift: the
harness source itself calls that control "an INSTRUMENT CHECK and not a result".

GUARD: ProgressResult now records `explored_out`. Eval cells recorded `timed_out`
and `hit_induction_cap` but had no field for the explorer running out of frontier,
so an early stop for that reason was indistinguishable from an ordinary completion
that used fewer actions -- the ambiguity that let a 978-action DROP read as a win
when it was a frontier collapsing. Reporting only: read after the action loop,
never by it. Four tests cover both directions, distinctness from the other two
termination causes, and trajectory invariance; deleting the wiring fails two of
them, so the pattern is under test rather than decorative.

exp6021 rebuilt because artifact_freshness_lint correctly refused the commit (it
declares the changed file as a dependency). NO scientific number moved: 11 changed
leaves, all provenance/timing, verdict byte-identical. The rebuild did however
silently DROP four historical blocks a prior session had hand-added; all four were
restored and the builder defect is recorded in the artifact.

No default flipped, no game played, no scored/online submission, no hidden-game
source read. Evidence dirs untouched (load_engine monkeypatched throughout).
Mutation gate clean; only my own paths staged.

